

**[11.12]**V. R. Bursian and V. Fock, Table of the functions \(\int_{x}^{\infty}K_{0}(x)dx,\int_{1}^{x}I_{0}(x)dx,e^{-\int_{x}^{\infty}K_{0}(x) dx,e^{-\int_{x}^{\infty}I_{0}(x)dx,}}\) Akad. Nauk, Leningrad, Inst. Fis. Mat., Trudy (Travaux) 2, 6-10 (1931). \(\int_{x}^{\infty}K_{0}(0)dt,\) \(x\) =0(.1)12, 7D; \(e^{-\int_{x}^{\infty}K_{0}(0)dt,}\) =0(.1)16, 7D; \(e^{-z}\int_{x}^{x}I_{0}(0)dt,\) =0(.1)16, 7D.
